                "description": "Baldwin 6573 Springfield Handleset - The 6573 Springfield Mortise Door Entrance Set is available as either a single cylinder or a dummy set. Made by Baldwin, this traditional handleset is fashioned out of solid brass and is backed by a limited lifetime warranty on the workmanship, materials, operation, and finish. It is available in many beautiful finishes, all of which accentuate the classic allure of the oval shape. It will fit 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses and with backsets of 2-1/2 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
